"hook": "This antibiotic was found in soil from Mount Ararat ⛰️",
"fact": "Daptomycin is made by Streptomyces roseosporus, a bacterium isolated from a soil sample from Mount Ararat in Turkey. It works by inserting into the bacterial cell membrane, and lung surfactant inactivates it, so it does not treat pneumonia.",
